**Summary of the Fix:**
- Adds a `setStyle(style)` method to `WebGLTileLayer`.
- Updates the internal style and style variables.
- Calls `this.changed()` to trigger a re-render and shader rebuild with the new style.

This patch enables dynamic style changes for `WebGLTileLayer` without removing and re-adding the layer, as requested.
